  "Scenes.Ivorysuccubusscene.Deny.ShallNotSuccumb": "You shall not succumb to her, not here, not now. Despite your battered body and pride, you resist. To this, the ivory succubus huffs in disappointment. [say: You will see the truth, eventually. Your ugly imperfections will damn you if you continue denying this gift.] She walks away, robbing you of anything to hold your attention as you drift off and rest"
