  "Scenes.Ivorysuccubusscene.Encounter.RemainingAttentive": "Remaining attentive of your surroundings as you travel, you notice a shadow casting down on you, and turn immediately to see the source."
  "Scenes.Ivorysuccubusscene.Encounter.StandingAtop": "[pg]Standing tall atop a rock is a slender silhouette in the [sun]light. The petite, sleek shape of her body is not what you would expect to be paired with her lengthy horns and vast wings. Snaking out behind her is a rope-thick tail that ends in ridges and a cute spade. She descends from her perch and lands a safe distance away, now at an angle that clearly lights her alabaster flesh."
  "Scenes.Ivorysuccubusscene.Kill.CordSlings": "The cord of your [weapon] slings around her neck with a simple motion, and you yank her toward you. She chokes and gags, struggling meekly, before soon losing consciousness, and her life passes soon after."
