  "Scenes.Ivorysuccubusscene.Kill.GrippingWeapon": "Gripping your [weapon] in both hands, you swing it heavily into the succubus's neck, ending her in quick fashion."
  "Scenes.Ivorysuccubusscene.Kill.HeavyLunge": "A heavy lunge forces your [weapon] into the demon's chest. She chokes and coughs as blood comes up her throat, but it doesn't last long."
