  "Scenes.Ivorysuccubusscene.Kill.PerfectCut": "A perfect cut for this self-proclaimed perfect being, you decide, as you ready your masterfully-crafted blade. You lift it up high, pointing to the sky, and the succubus sits upright to look in awe at the glistening metal. Down it swings, already beneath her before she registers it was moving. She stares on, stunned. Putting the blade into its sheathe, you prepare to leave, and give your good-bye to a decent fighter. At the click of your weapon returning to its place, the demoness splits in two, falling to both sides."
